# Vug Lizard {1}{R}{R}, "Echo {1}{R}{R}" (CR 702.30a). Cast on turn 1 (paid with generic from Sol Ring's colorless mana and R mana), it came under Bot1's control since the beginning of their last upkeep, so at Bot1's turn 3 upkeep the echo ability
